{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09555","headline":"送僧 · 张谓","name":"送僧","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"童子学修道，诵经求出家。\n手持贝多叶，心念优昙花。\n得度北州近，随缘东路赊。\n一身求清净，百毳纳袈裟。\n锺岭更飞锡，炉峰期结跏。\n深心大海水，广愿恒河沙。\n此去不堪别，彼行安可涯。\n殷勤结香火，来世上牛车。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张谓","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09555.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09555","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}